<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Experiment Setup ‣ Cross-Layer Attention Probing for Fine-Grained Hallucination Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Implementation Details</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
